    given-names: Aleksei
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexeysakhalin/Chemokines-as-Regulators-of-CAR-T-Cell"
url: "https://github.com/alexeysakhalin/Chemokines-as-Regulators-of-CAR-T-Cell"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-07"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible exploratory reanalysis of public CAR-T single-cell cohorts,
  including patient-level longitudinal CXCR6 transcript detection and a
  descriptive ICANS spatial analysis. The repository also supplies reusable
  analysis functions and clearly labeled synthetic software-test inputs.
keywords:
  - CAR-T cells
  - chemokines
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - CITE-seq
  - spatial biology
  - CXCL16
  - chemotaxis
  - reproducible research
